{"id":"lazada-doc-108249","platform":"lazada","section":"developer-guide","title":"Finance API","breadcrumb":["Lazada","Developer Guide","API Reference","Finance API"],"label":"LAZADA · DEVELOPER GUIDE","subtitle":"Last modified 2024-07-19 13:49:49","meta":[{"text":"guide"},{"text":"Official docs","url":"https://open.lazada.com/apps/doc/doc?docId=108249"},{"text":"Console","url":"https://open.lazada.com/apps/console"}],"html":"<p>The table below lists APIs that can be used for viewing and analyzing seller finance data.</p>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th align=\"left\"><strong>API name</strong> </th>\n      <th align=\"left\"><strong>Description</strong> </th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"left\"><a href='https://open.lazada.com/apps/doc/api?path=%2Ffinance%2Fpayout%2Fstatus%2Fget' target='_brank'>GetPayoutStatus</a> </td>\n      <td align=\"left\">Get the payout status of the seller in a specified period. </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"left\"><a href='https://open.lazada.com/apps/doc/api?path=%2Ffinance%2Ftransaction%2Fdetails%2Fget' target='_brank'>queryTransactionDetails</a> </td>\n      <td align=\"left\">API to query seller transaction details within specific date range. </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"left\"><a href='https://open.lazada.com/apps/doc/api?path=%2Ffinance%2Ftransaction%2FaccountTransactions%2Fquery' target='_brank'>QueryAccountTransactions</a> </td>\n      <td align=\"left\">API to query account transactions. </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>"}